# Line endings for controldesk_automation
#
# This project is authored on macOS and deployed to Windows
# (F:\ZYS_HYBASE\automation). Deployment verification compares SHA-256 per file
# (see docs/DIRECTORY_LAYOUT.md), so line endings are part of the verified
# payload: a checkout that silently rewrites them would invalidate every hash
# without changing behaviour. Hence the rules below pin the *existing* state
# rather than imposing a new one.
#
# Default: LF everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Exception: these were produced by PowerShell on work-pc (`Out-File` emits
# CRLF). They are captured reference output, not authored source, so they keep
# their native CRLF. Rewriting them to LF would change 5 deployed files for no
# benefit.
/docs/reference/** text eol=crlf

# Exception: the live rig configuration. It was historically maintained on
# Windows and was mixed (109 CRLF + 10 stray LF); it is now uniformly CRLF.
# Kept as CRLF to preserve its long-standing on-disk form.
/scope_bench/bench_config.json text eol=crlf


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Binaries: never convert, never diff.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tar binary

# Measurement data and MATLAB artefacts (not currently tracked, listed so they
# stay safe if they are ever committed by accident).
*.mf4 binary
*.mat binary
*.slx binary
*.fig binary

# Compiled / native artefacts (ignored by .gitignore, belt-and-braces here).
*.pyc binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.a binary
